    {
      "name": "Execution Stream",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "execution-stream",
      "description": "394px scripted replay stream marked 'Simulation · not a terminal'.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stream\"><div class=\"ds-stream-top\"><strong>Execution stream</strong><span>Scripted replay of the example run · read-only</span><span class=\"ds-stream-badge\">Simulation · not a terminal</span></div><div class=\"ds-stream-body\"><ul class=\"ds-list\"><li><time>00:04</time><strong>Daytona</strong><span>Places PERSONA.md, PROJECT.md and WORKORDER.md in 5 independent workspaces [illustrative].</span></li><li><time>00:06</time><strong>Product Strategist</strong><span>Writes validation-plan.md around testable hypotheses and repeat use.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"ds-stream-foot\">Each line is prepared example activity embedded in this page. No commands run and no provider is contacted.</div></div>",
      "css": ":host,:root{--navy:#0f1e3a;--navy-2:#1a2d52;--blue:#1f6feb;--blue-dark:#1758c4;--blue-50:#eef4ff;--blue-100:#dde9fc;--line:#d8e4f4;--canvas:#f3f7fd;--paper:#fff;--ink:#12223d;--text:#26364f;--muted:#5a6982;--stream:#0b1528;--stream-line:#1d2c47;--stream-text:#c9d6ea;--amber:#8a5a12;--amber-bg:#fbf1dc;--radius:13px;--focus:#1f6feb;font:14px/1.6 'Segoe UI',system-ui,-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--text)} .ds-stream{background:var(--stream);border-radius:12px;height:394px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;color:var(--stream-text);border:1px solid #1b2a46}.ds-stream-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--stream-line);font-size:12px;color:#8ea2c4;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-stream-top strong{color:#e8eefb}.ds-stream-badge{border:1px solid #344a72;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px;color:#ffd58a}.ds-stream-body{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:6px 16px 10px}.ds-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.ds-list li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:46px 132px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #15223a;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}.ds-list time{font:11px/1.9 Consolas,monospace;color:#6f84a8}.ds-list strong{color:#8fb9ff;font-weight:600}.ds-stream-foot{padding:8px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--stream-line);font-size:12px;color:#6f84a8}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Decision Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "decision-card",
      "description": "Navy gradient decision summary on the Decision board.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-decision\"><div class=\"ds-decision-top\"><span>Overall direction · authored sample</span><span class=\"ds-tag\">Reviewing: full launch</span></div><h2>Before a full launch,<br>start with a small paid pilot.</h2><div class=\"ds-decision-bottom\"><span><b>5 valid opinions</b> · 0 incomplete · illustrative data</span><span>Reliability status <b>awaiting external validation</b></span></div></div>",
